### Test Reminder service (thoi tiet) bang extension REST Client trong VS Code
### Can chay: Docker, Identity (5101), Reminder (5104). Can Internet de goi Open-Meteo
@host = http://localhost:5104
@identity = http://localhost:5101

### 1. Service con song khong -> 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Dang nhap lay token
# @name login
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 3. Thoi tiet mac dinh (TP.HCM) -> 200: current, forecast (3 ngay), heatwave
GET {{host}}/api/weather
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Thoi tiet Ha Noi
GET {{host}}/api/weather?lat=21.0285&lon=105.8542&name=Ha%20Noi
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Toa do sai -> 400 {"message":"Invalid coordinates."}
GET {{host}}/api/weather?lat=999&lon=0
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Khong gui token -> 401 (bao mat)
GET {{host}}/api/weather

### 7. Thu canh bao nang nong: doi "HeatwaveThresholdC" trong appsettings.json xuong 20,
### chay lai service, goi request 3. heatwave.tomorrow = true va co 1 thong bao "heatwave"
### trong Notification service (xem HUONG-DAN-THAN.md muc Test).
